[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA: global identity.js (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mOne new file, one script tag per page, all storage centralized behind it. No change to how you develop. Module [39m
     [38;5;246mformat and eventing stay cheap retrofits.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m C: store + login event
